>> Animal := Ntho ncha.
Animal ha-ho-fihla: ['sound:'] etsa: { :s ea-hao sound := s. }.
Animal ha-ho-fihla: ['makeSound'] etsa: { Sephetho ngola: ea-hao sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal ncha.
Cat ha-ho-fihla: ['init'] etsa: { ea-hao sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat ha-ho-fihla: ['meow'] etsa: { uena makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
